    <div class="principles-grid">
      <div class="principle-card">
        <h3>Custom code, every time</h3>
        <p>I write every line of code for your business instead of using drag-and-drop builders or AI-generated templates. That's why my sites score 95 to 100 on Google's speed test, where 50 to 70 has become typical for the major platforms.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="principle-card">
        <h3>One flat monthly price</h3>
        <p>For $175 a month, you get the design, the build, hosting, the security certificate, security work, unlimited content updates, and direct support from me. There's no setup fee, no hourly meter, and no "that part is extra" conversation later.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="principle-card">
        <h3>You talk to me directly</h3>
        <p>The person who answers your text is the person who wrote the code on your site. Email, call, or text, and your message comes straight to me.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="principle-card">
        <h3>A site that works for your business</h3>
        <p>A service-business website exists to bring in calls and book jobs. I build everything around that: intake forms made for your trade, careful local search work, and pages fast enough that customers stay to read the headline.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="principle-card">
        <h3>An open book</h3>
        <p>Every tool I use is listed on the <a href="/tools/" class="inline-link">tools page</a>, and the full service agreement is published on the <a href="/agreement/" class="inline-link">agreement page</a>. If you want to know how something works, you can read the answer here before we ever talk.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="principle-card">
        <h3>I take responsibility</h3>
        <p>Hosting, security, uptime, the code, and the launch are mine to handle. When something goes wrong, I fix it, and you get on with your day.</p>
